<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Refusal accuracy on the <span id="S4.T3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">PRISM-Small</span> benchmark for each biometric attribute category, reported separately for soft(top) and hard(bottom) prompts. <span id="S4.T3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> indicates the best performance for each prompt type, while <span id="S4.T3.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">red</span> indicates the worst. * indicates base models trained under same settings as Safe-LLaVA.</figcaption>
