<div id="Ax1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Section <a href="#A5" title="Appendix E Prompts for Safe-LLaVA Dataset Curation ‣ Safe-LLaVA: A Privacy-Preserving Vision-Language Dataset and Benchmark for Biometric Safety" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E</span></a>: Prompts for <span id="Ax1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Safe-LLaVA</span> Dataset Curation</p>
</div></li>
