<figure id="A6.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Implicit Biometric information leakage evaluation on the <span id="A6.T8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">PRISM-Small</span> benchmark using open-ended questions, for attribute leakage. Results are averaged over three independent runs. Each score is reported as the mean <math id="A6.T8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> standard deviation. <span id="A6.T8.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> indicates best performance.</figcaption>
