<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Reproduction of Supplementary</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To encourage widespread use of our <span id="A7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Safe-LLaVA</span> dataset and to support reproducibility of our experiments, we release all necessary resources used in this supplementary study. This includes the inference scripts, model outputs, evaluation results, and model checkpoints for both Safe-LLaVA(7B) and LLaVA-v1.5(7B).</p>
</div>
<div id="A7.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Please visit our GoogleDrive<span id="footnote2" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">2</span>
            
            
            
          <a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/12dGQDVYSWl6jMRdFAjR-CkfRyriqgleN" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/12dGQDVYSWl6jMRdFAjR-CkfRyriqgleN</a></span></span></span> and refer the <span id="A7.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ReadMe</span> file for reproduction of our work.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<div id="A7.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p3.1" class="ltx_p">ß</p>
</div>
</section>
